{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0c79aa9dc5a833d8fa1","chatId":"06719cf1741a48b8bd7262c4c61e3bb9","sessionId":null,"userId":98663,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n\"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n\"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1632,"promptTokens":1517,"completionTokens":107,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:35"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007573364993532061,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0c79aa9dc5a833d8fa0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482375382,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0c79aa9dc5a833d8fa0","chatId":"06719cf1741a48b8bd7262c4c61e3bb9","sessionId":null,"userId":98663,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n佳恩的妈妈很严格，在家里总是否定她的优点。一天，佳恩把考了95分的试卷给妈妈看。佳恩的妈妈只说了这么简单的试卷应该考满分。但是出门遇到了其他家长，聊到成绩时，佳恩妈妈会激动地夸奖自己的孩子。面对在外人前的夸奖，佳恩露出烦躁的表情。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，佳恩最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 爱护\nB) 感激\nC) 娱乐\nD) 嫉妒\nE) 厌恶\nF) 伤感\n\n## 问题 2\n佳恩为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 因为她的母亲总是批评她，而在别人面前又表扬她\nB) 她的母亲只关注佳恩的成就\nC) 她的母亲与他人公开讨论佳恩的成绩\nD) 她不喜欢其他父母.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007573364993532061,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0c79aa9dc5a833d8fa1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482375379,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7714da1953c942b7945633a6fbc23df2"}